{"id":"01b7b9d9615ddaa5","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-language-pumping-length.md","title":"Canonical Pumping Length of a Regular Language","display":"df-regular-pumping-length — Canonical Pumping Length of a Regular Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-language-pumping-length","aliases":["73-df-language-pumping-length","73-df-regular-pumping-length"],"display":"df-regular-pumping-length — Canonical Pumping Length of a Regular Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-language-pumping-length"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-language-pumping-length</span><span>73-df-regular-pumping-length</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-pumping-length — Canonical Pumping Length of a Regular Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (regular language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> (DFA and its language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}length}\\vdash\np_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\bigl\\{|Q|:\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists F\\;\n\\bigl((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F))\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}length}\\vdash\np_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\bigl\\{|Q|:\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists F\\;\n\\bigl((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F))\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The minimized set is a nonempty subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is regular, so its minimum exists.</li>\n<li>A run of length at least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\">\\(p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\)</span> in a minimal DFA repeats a state and supplies the pumping decomposition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular language, see [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$ and $L(M)$ (DFA and its language, see [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}length}\\vdash\np_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\bigl\\{|Q|:\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists F\\;\n\\bigl((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F))\\bigr)\\bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)","display":false}],"bytes":1255,"backlinks":[{"id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)$ (canonical pumping length, see [[73-df-language-pumping-length]])"},{"id":"ce1461d3e7bc342b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)$ (minimum DFA state count for a regular language, see [[73-df-language-pumping-length]])"}],"outgoing":["3b7a967565c86f39","c284ffb568a496fd"]}